 {'slug':'getting-started','category':'Membership','label':'Evergreen guide','featured':True,'title':'How to join City Boy Movement','excerpt':'A simple guide to the national registration page and where to find the Ogun State selection.','seoTitle':'How to Join City Boy Movement from Ogun State','seoDescription':'Learn how to join City Boy Movement through the national registration platform, select Ogun State and find guidance on membership and account enquiries.','bodyHtml':'<p>Membership registration is handled by the national City Boy Movement platform. This chapter website provides a direct link to that platform.</p><h2>Start on the national website</h2><ol><li>Open the national registration page using the button below.</li><li>Follow the instructions and provide the information requested on that platform.</li><li>Select Ogun State, your LGA and ward where the registration flow asks for them.</li><li>Review the national platform’s terms and privacy information before submitting.</li></ol><p>Any account, identity verification or membership-card questions should be directed to the national platform. This Ogun chapter website does not manage member records.</p>'+join('dark')},
